  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delivery of critical WASH supplies and winterised bathing facilities for the most vulnerable people in affected areas of Batken and Osh oblasts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) assistance to vulnerable communities affected by hostilities. This UNICEF project provides fresh water and winterisation sanitation services to affected households. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 6,000 people, including 1,616 women, 521 men, 3,863 children, and including 600 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
